256:3e403f869f8ac663beee431b1cf999996c824a53e24af3f9d3e1b03d30710a1b, and its stored document is sha256:80a4daab4d372f2a4025313631beb63bb96309f0f200268da49b88ab46ac3756.\",\"evidence\":\"apply-declared-change COMMITTED; read-declared-capability-document $.documentDigest sha256:80a4daab4d372f2a4025313631beb63bb96309f0f200268da49b88ab46ac3756\"}]}"}';
